type: dataset
title: "Supporting data for a genome-scale, hypothesis-guided survey of protein candidates relevant to sulfur metabolism and volatile chemistry in Cannabis sativa"
abstract: >-
  Query definitions, search assignments, staged validation results, retained
  candidate sequences, expression cross-references, and PF01053 phylogenetic
  artifacts supporting a survey of Cannabis sativa protein candidates.
